          "id": "03-hybrid-retrieval-notes.md::0::b71c485c",
          "title": "Reading Notes on Hybrid Retrieval",
          "source": "03-hybrid-retrieval-notes.md",
          "chunkIndex": 0,
          "snippet": "Hybrid retrieval combines a lexical branch with a semantic branch and fuses the two rankings. Reciprocal Rank Fusion is the usual choice because it only consumes ranks, not raw scores, so the two branches do not need calibration.",
          "hitBy": "both",
          "rrfScore": 0.0328,
          "vecRank": 1,
          "ftRank": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "01-向量检索基础.md::0::84ff3cff",
          "title": "向量检索基础笔记",
          "source": "01-向量检索基础.md",
          "chunkIndex": 0,
          "snippet": "混合检索是把「关键词检索」和「语义检索」两路结果合并排序。最常见的融合方式是 RRF（Reciprocal Rank Fusion）：对每一路结果按名次算分，公式是 1/(k + rank)，k 通常取 60，然后把两路分数相加再排序。 RRF 的好处是不用归一化两边的原始分数。BM25 分数和余弦相似度量纲完全不同，直接加权很脆，RRF 只用名次，鲁棒得多。 HNSW 是一种近似最近邻图索引。查询时从入口点出发，沿着「离查询更近的邻居」贪心下降，最后得到近似的 top-k。它的召回率与搜索速度由 ef_construction 和 ef_search 两个参数控制。",
          "hitBy": "both",
          "rrfScore": 0.032,
          "vecRank": 3,
          "ftRank": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "01-向量检索基础.md::1::83ff3b6c",
